<title>USA: Supreme Industries sets stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Supreme Industries sets stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>GOSHEN, Ind. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Supreme Industries Inc said Tuesday its board authorized the repurchase of up to 500,000 common shares through the close of business November 28, 1997.</p>
<p>There are currently more than eight million Class A common shares in public hands, said the company.</p>
<p>Supreme Industries is a manufacturer of custom-designed, specialized truck bodies.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
